Daniil Ankushin | Nethermind: So, we basically… the idea, basically, is to use, current MaxVerify gas as.

380
00:51:15.300 --> 00:51:28.399
Daniil Ankushin | Nethermind: floor, not as a limitation. So, yeah, basically, if we have, we have, let's say, 100% nodes that

